      "english",
      "现在完成时"
    ],
    "subject": "english",
    "stem": "I ____ already ____ my homework.",
    "stem_image": null,
    "options": [
      {
        "label": "A",
        "text": "have ... finish"
      },
      {
        "label": "B",
        "text": "have ... finished"
      },
      {
        "label": "C",
        "text": "has ... finished"
      },
      {
        "label": "D",
        "text": "had ... finish"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "B",
    "explanation": "现在完成时的结构是 \"have/has + 过去分词\"。主语 I 用 have，finish 的过去分词是 finished。already（已经）常用于现在完成时的肯定句中，放在 have 和过去分词之间。",
    "hint": "现在完成时的构成：have/has + 动词的过去分词。I 后面用 have 还是 has？",
    "time_limit_seconds": 30,
    "points": 10,
    "version": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-03-27",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-27"
  },
  {
    "id": "intellect_q_1701",
    "module": "intellect",
    "type": "question",
    "subtype": "choice",
    "grade_min": 7,
    "grade_max": 9,
    "difficulty": 4,
    "tags": [
      "english",
      "现在完成时"
    ],
    "subject": "english",
    "stem": "She has lived in Beijing ____ 2018.",
    "stem_image": null,
    "options": [
      {
        "label": "A",
        "text": "for"
      },
      {
        "label": "B",
        "text": "since"
      },
      {
        "label": "C",
        "text": "in"
      },
      {
        "label": "D",
        "text": "from"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "B",
    "explanation": "现在完成时中，since 后接时间点（如 2018, last year, Monday），表示\"自从……以来\"。for 后接时间段（如 three years, two hours）。2018 是一个时间点，所以用 since。",
    "hint": "since 后面跟时间点，for 后面跟时间段。2018 是时间点还是时间段？",
    "time_limit_seconds": 30,
    "points": 10,
    "version": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-03-27",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-27"
  },
  {
    "id": "intellect_q_1702",
    "module": "intellect",
    "type": "question",
    "subtype": "choice",
    "grade_min": 7,
    "grade_max": 9,
    "difficulty": 4,
    "tags": [
      "english",
      "被动语态"
    ],
    "subject": "english",
    "stem": "The bridge ____ in 1990.",
    "stem_image": null,
    "options": [
      {
        "label": "A",
        "text": "built"
      },
      {
        "label": "B",
        "text": "was built"
      },
      {
        "label": "C",
        "text": "is built"
      },
      {
        "label": "D",
        "text": "has built"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "B",
    "explanation": "桥是\"被建造\"的，要用被动语态。被动语态的结构是 \"be + 过去分词\"。因为时间是 1990 年（过去），所以用一般过去时的被动语态：was built。",
    "hint": "桥不能自己建造自己，它是\"被建造\"的。过去时间用 was/were。",
    "time_limit_seconds": 30,
    "points": 10,
    "version": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-03-27",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-27"
  },
  {
    "id": "intellect_q_1703",
    "module": "intellect",
    "type": "question",
    "subtype": "choice",
    "grade_min": 7,
    "grade_max": 9,
    "difficulty": 4,
    "tags": [
      "english",
      "被动语态"
    ],
    "subject": "english",
    "stem": "English ____ all over the world.",
    "stem_image": null,
    "options": [
      {
        "label": "A",
        "text": "speaks"
      },
      {
        "label": "B",
        "text": "spoke"
      },
      {
        "label": "C",
        "text": "is spoken"
      },
      {
        "label": "D",
        "text": "is speaking"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "C",
    "explanation": "英语是\"被说\"的（被人们使用），要用被动语态。这是一个客观事实，用一般现在时的被动语态：is spoken。主语 English 是单数，所以用 is。",
    "hint": "英语不是自己\"说\"自己，而是\"被（全世界的人）说\"。",
    "time_limit_seconds": 30,
    "points": 10,
    "version": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-03-27",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-27"
  },
  {
    "id": "intellect_q_1704",
    "module": "intellect",
    "type": "question",
    "subtype": "choice",
    "grade_min": 7,
    "grade_max": 9,
    "difficulty": 4,
    "tags": [
      "english",
      "定语从句"
    ],
    "subject": "english",
    "stem": "The boy ____ is wearing a red shirt is my brother.",
    "stem_image": null,
    "options": [
      {
        "label": "A",
        "text": "which"
      },
      {
        "label": "B",
        "text": "who"
      },
      {
        "label": "C",
        "text": "whom"
      },
      {
        "label": "D",
        "text": "what"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "B",
    "explanation": "先行词是 the boy（人），在定语从句中作主语，应该用关系代词 who。which 用于修饰物，whom 用于作宾语，what 不能引导定语从句。",
    "hint": "先行词是人（boy），在从句中作主语（穿着红衬衫的是谁），应该用哪个关系代词？",
    "time_limit_seconds": 30,
    "points": 10,
    "version": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-03-27",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-27"
  },
  {
    "id": "intellect_q_1705",
    "module": "intellect",
    "type": "question",
    "subtype": "choice",
    "grade_min": 7,
    "grade_max": 9,
    "difficulty": 4,
    "tags": [
      "english",
      "定语从句"
    ],
    "subject": "english",
    "stem": "This is the book ____ I bought yesterday.",
    "stem_image": null,
    "options": [
      {
        "label": "A",
        "text": "who"
      },
      {
        "label": "B",
        "text": "what"
      },
      {
        "label": "C",
        "text": "which"
      },
      {
        "label": "D",
        "text": "where"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "C",
    "explanation": "先行词是 the book（物），在定语从句中作 bought 的宾语，应该用关系代词 which（也可以用 that）。who 用于修饰人，what 不引导定语从句，where 引导地点状语从句。",
    "hint": "先行词是物（book），用哪个关系代词来引导定语从句？",
    "time_limit_seconds": 30,
    "points": 10,
    "version": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-03-27",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-27"
  },
  {
